01:20:32.202 --> 01:20:34.963
I hear Nina travelled
around Europe for a while


01:20:35.122 --> 01:20:38.362
and eventually got a job
at a fancy restaurant in Rome.


01:20:38.521 --> 01:20:42.482
This year, her parents are going to
visit her for Thanksgiving.


01:20:48.600 --> 01:20:50.248
I'm not saying
what happened last Christmas


01:20:50.400 --> 01:20:52.484
happened solely
because of Nina.


01:20:53.840 --> 01:20:57.288
I'm saying maybe what happened
needed to happen,


01:20:57.440 --> 01:20:59.764
even for me.


01:21:02.320 --> 01:21:04.044
- Ah!
- Whoa! Whoa!


01:21:04.200 --> 01:21:06.087
My dad came into the city
the other day


01:21:06.240 --> 01:21:08.040
to celebrate my new job.


01:21:09.199 --> 01:21:11.720
He told me he offered the house
to my mom but...


01:21:11.880 --> 01:21:13.363
...she didn't want it.


01:21:13.520 --> 01:21:17.240
He thought about selling
but decided to hold onto it


01:21:17.399 --> 01:21:18.882
for when Toby and I
come visit.


01:21:19.039 --> 01:21:21.679
He's still
figuring things out.


01:21:21.839 --> 01:21:25.286
But, luckily, he has
his best friend to help with that.


01:22:45.754 --> 01:22:49.201
# I saw you, I found you


01:22:49.354 --> 01:22:52.681
# I watched you grow


01:22:52.833 --> 01:22:55.681
# Slowly but surely


01:22:55.834 --> 01:22:59.914
# We ebb and we ﬂow


01:23:00.073 --> 01:23:03.401
# I felt a change


01:23:03.552 --> 01:23:06.957
# Deep in my bones


01:23:07.112 --> 01:23:11.837
# Something new


01:23:11.992 --> 01:23:14.033
# Has grown


01:23:19.632 --> 01:23:22.959
# I was inside waiting


01:23:23.112 --> 01:23:26.559
# Eyes open wide


01:23:26.711 --> 01:23:32.396
# I felt the ground beneath me wake


01:23:33.831 --> 01:23:37.236
# I felt a change


01:23:37.391 --> 01:23:40.839
# Deep in my bones


01:23:40.990 --> 01:23:46.555
# Something new


01:23:46.711 --> 01:23:48.794
# Has grown


01:24:02.229 --> 01:24:04.749
# Up in your room


01:24:04.909 --> 01:24:09.274
# Was a great silent storm


01:24:09.429 --> 01:24:10.673
# Clouds have cleared


01:24:10.829 --> 01:24:15.313
# The air was sweet and warm. #

